  both-keys branches, and the `hasObsidian` inspection. Add a
  sentence stating that the prescription's args may contain `null`
  entries when the brain.aide path slot is YAML null, and that the
  step emits the same shape regardless — sync (downstream) refuses
  to write null-bearing args to `.mcp.json`, so a partially-wired
  brain configuration cannot silently land.

