### 6. Verify the seven-step ordering and the path-propagation invariants end-to-end

Read: `coding-playbook/workflow/testing`

A brief verification step — no new code or tests; just walk the
output of the seven-step pipeline by hand against the spec's
worked good-example to catch regressions the unit tests might
miss.

